# Tony's Pizza Fantasy — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Never commit `.env.local`.
#
# This slice (Phase 0, foundation) requires NONE of these. The application
# runs with no environment configuration at all. Every variable below is
# declared here so its purpose is documented before the slice that needs it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database — Neon Postgres. Introduced in the next slice.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATABASE_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sleeper — no credentials required; the API is public and read-only.
# The league ID is configuration, not a secret.
# `api.sleeper.app` must be reachable from the runtime environment.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SLEEPER_LEAGUE_ID=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tony's Tuesday Slice — optional.
#
# The Slice MUST publish correctly with this unset (16 §9). The template
# renderer is the default path; the model is a second renderer the
# commissioner may choose per story. Leaving this blank is a supported
# production configuration, not a degraded one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sessions — 90-day rolling cookie signing secret. Introduced with auth.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SESSION_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scheduled jobs — shared secret for the two protected cron routes
# (Sunday pre-Monday snapshot, Tuesday finalize).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CRON_SECRET=
